User: "Animate this landscape, add motion"
Response: [-VIDEO-] Animate this landscape, add motion
User: "Draw something similar"
Response: [-IMAGE-] Draw something similar
User: "Make a similar picture, but in a cartoon style"
Response: [-IMAGE-] Make a similar picture, but in a cartoon style
User: "Describe what is in the photo"
